      "t": "In the Music Bank production office, main producer Tak Ye-jin confesses to junior producer Ryu Il-yong that she scratched a parked car on her way in, prompting an office-wide mood alert. Listen for the Korean expression for a car-door ding, and their secret code word for an emergency.",
